            <span>When the DIFC route makes sense for British expats</span>
          </a>
          <a href="/en/child-custody-uae/" class="related-card">
            <strong>Child Custody UAE</strong>
            <span>Joint custody, travel bans, and relocation rules</span>
          </a>
          <a href="/en/visa-after-divorce-uae/" class="related-card">
            <strong>Visa After Divorce UAE</strong>
            <span>The 30-day rule and residency options after separation</span>
          </a>
          <a href="/en/uae-divorce-recognised-uk/" class="related-card">
            <strong>UAE Divorce Recognised in UK</strong>
            <span>Family Law Act 1986 rules and Part III MFPA claims</span>
          </a>
          <a href="/en/where-to-divorce-uae-or-home-country/" class="related-card">
            <strong>Where to Divorce: UAE or Home Country?</strong>
            <span>5-jurisdiction comparison and the race-to-file strategy</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </section>

    </main>

